# Digital Khata App (Array.prototype.flat() Demo)

A simple, practical JavaScript demonstration showing how `Array.prototype.flat()` works in a real-world scenario—building a daily **Digital Khata (Ledger)**.

---

##  The Thought Process & Concept Flow

Understanding abstract programming concepts like `Array.prototype.flat()` can be tricky when looking at basic syntax alone. This project was conceptualized through a real-life retail ledger analogy:

```text
[ Customer Input ] ──> [ Sub-Array (Session/Transaction) ] ──> [ Main Ledger (Nested Array) ]
                                                                             │
[ Rendered List ] <── [ Flattened 1D Array ] <── [ Array.prototype.flat() ] ─┘
